 is original illust of characters of Touhou Project.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299420/extras/f81265721da7057d4c3022dc7d2151b7.avif?t=1677780786\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boutique</h2>You can change Marisa's cloth.<br>Find your favorite cloth and fly in Gensokyo.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299420/extras/f7a90a46437df1dc7b76820c451c10c1.avif?t=1677780786\" /></div>",
